# Keep the build context small and reproducible.
#
# The six deploy/Dockerfile.* images use `COPY . .` with the repository root as
# their context, so anything not excluded here is sent to the daemon and baked
# into every one of them. This tree is a worst case for that: five stale
# host-built service binaries sit at the repository root (~130 MB), frontend/
# carries node_modules, and .git is substantial.
#
# NOT excluded, deliberately: internal/frontend/dist — the Go binary embeds it
# via `//go:embed all:dist`, so dropping it breaks the build. build/frontend/
# is the staging copy and is excluded; the embedded one is not.

# VCS and CI config — never needed inside the image
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github/

# Stale host-built service binaries at the repository root. These are
# gitignored leftovers from an older layout that wrote binaries here instead of
# build/bin/; they are large, and shipping a host build into an image that is
# supposed to compile its own is exactly the confusion to avoid.
/signald
/key-transparency
/registration-service
/svr2
/storage-service

# Build output and host binaries
build/
bin/
dist/
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Node modules for the web UI — the deploy images consume the prebuilt
# internal/frontend/dist, never the sources
frontend/node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# Local runtime state
data/

# Test and coverage artifacts, regenerated in the container
coverage/
*.test
*.out
*.prof
*.log

# A stray go.work silently changes module resolution inside the build
go.work
go.work.sum
vendor/

# Editor, agent and OS noise
.idea/
.vscode/
.claude/
.serena/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Docker files themselves
.dockerignore
Dockerfile*
deploy/Dockerfile*
.devcontainer/

# BuildKit credential staging file (dependency-resolution.md §6). The canonical
# Gitea module-credential pattern mounts these variables via
# --mount=type=secret and the file is meant to live OUTSIDE the build context;
# this line is the second line of defence, so that a copy landing in the tree
# by accident can never be baked into a layer by a broad COPY.
gomodauth*
